<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Lord, I do not have all the words</l><l>To speak my love out to You.</l><l>For Your love to me surpasses</l><l>All words that ever I knew.</l><l>All the languages, though so different</l><l>They all can say the same thing—</l><l>That my love for You is great.</l><l>I love You, Lord—O so much!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
